  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skattereform, Projektutformning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax System Reform, Inception phase - Moldovan Tax System Reform - I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning av den projektutformning som Skatteverket genomf&#xF6;rde under perioden december 2011 - februari 2011. Det framtida st&#xF6;det till Skattereformprojektet kommer att utarbetas, b&#xE5;de g&#xE4;llande inneh&#xE5;ll och tidsplan, liksom en resultatmatris.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation of the Projekt Identification Mission carried out by Swedish Tax Agency during the period December 2010 - February 2011. The future Tax Reform project will be developed in details, both regarding content and a time schedule, as well as a results matrix containing objectives, indicators and results for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
